    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="21.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 21.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hit ðonne dierneð, ⁊ weorðeð ymb long yppe, ðonne rymeð he ðæm deaden to ðæm æðe, ðæt hine moton his mægas unsyngian.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he conceals [the killing], but it is revealed after a while, then he clears the way to the oath [being sworn] for the dead man, so that his kinsmen may prove him innocent.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he [who slew him] conceals the fact, but long afterwards it comes to light — by such conduct he affords an opportunity to the dead man to obtain an oath, by which his relatives may exculpate him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he hit þonne dirneð, ⁊ wurð ymb long yppe, ðonne rymeð he ðam deaden to ðam æðe, þæt hine moton his magas unscyldigne gedón.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
